From 6bc129683736240a2e429c3b3c232a689c12b1ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:20:11 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: Juxtopposed side panel Home and Playlists views

Adds a Home view to the player side panel library with short Continue Watching, New Music, Folders, Playlists and Artists sections, and a Playlists view that opens into each playlist's items. The list header gains a reverse order button and a search field, and rows move to their own SidePanelLibraryRow.qml so both views share them.
